OL,3,GNEWSA11-year-old heads to Pokemon World
OL,4,AChampionship
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 11-year-old is set to take on the
OL,7,Fworld's best players at the Pokemon
OL,8,FWorld Championships in America.
OL,10,FDeclan from Portsmouth is set to take
OL,11,Fpart in his the trading card tournament
OL,12,Fin San Francisco at the end of August.
OL,14,FThis is his third time at the world
OL,15,Fchampionships having started playing
OL,16,Fthe game aged eight and this time will
OL,17,Fcompete in the 12-year-old and under
OL,18,Fdivision with 350-400 other players.
OL,20,F"I'm excited - the goal is to win but I
OL,21,Fdon't really mind how I do as long as I
OL,22,Fhave fun," he said.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
